Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:28.65,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh, they were just thugs!\NThey went to the cops penniless!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to do with the syndicate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:25.53,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,Dammit, was just a salaried employee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,they just wanted money to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:28.65,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,that gave into his temptations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you caught the criminals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but no clue about\Nthe bounty we're really after?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:03:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They still use paper just\Nfor all the complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, they're just harassing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And, it's a waste of\Nvaluable resources!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The e-mail server is going down\Nfrom the sheer number of complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a movement out there\Nto sue our company for damages...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are\Nthe bounty-hunters doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have a huge bounty on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amigo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All you bounty-hunters in the{\i0}\N{\i1}Sol system, how are y'all doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once again, it's time for Big Shot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll start with today's hot news!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They apprehended the culprit in{\i0}\N{\i1}the series of recent Gate assaults!{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really? The bounty on him was{\i0}\N{\i1}12 million Woolongs, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the weird thing is that{\i0}\N{\i1}20 culprits were apprehended!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you mean?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, they were all caught in{\i0}\N{\i1}the act, but none were the mastermind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then you don't get the reward{\i0}\N{\i1}unless you find that mastermind?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But of course!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh my...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel sorry for all the guys{\i0}\N{\i1}who caught the culprits!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell do these thugs that normally just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,rob convenience stores attack at the Gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there are fads in crimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like "Hyperspace Gates are the in thing\Namong today's fashion-conscious kids!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"That girl won't even look your way until
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you assault at least one Gate!" or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we trade the\Ninformation that we each have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And split the bounty three ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that started all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,saying that we should research\Nthis case on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You also said that the occasional rivalry\Nbetween comrades would be good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, did the reward amount\Nmake you lose your memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You guys were really\Nkeen on the idea, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we all wanted\Nthe bounty to ourselves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In this case, all 20 cases{\i0}\N{\i1}were done the same way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of them infiltrated the tollbooth,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deftly attached the hacking unit,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and in the exact moment that passing ships\Naccess the tollbooth to pay the toll{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they steal the entire{\i0}\N{\i1}balance from the credit card.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Furthermore, the unit automatically{\i0}\N{\i1}sent the money data that it just stole.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It immediately launders all{\i0}\N{\i1}the funds in a bank on Europa,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}making it impossible to track where it went.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the culprits that were caught{\i0}\N{\i1}in the act have nothing in common.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Age, gender, nationality,{\i0}\N{\i1}religion, criminal record...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And on top of it, nobody has any of\Nthe money that they supposedly stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's about all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy that I nabbed said that\Nhe was just following
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the instructions from a manual\Nthat he got through mail-order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the other culprits are\Nreading the same manual that he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Manual?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"A new criminal support software.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's a real bargain.\NFor the low introductory price
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,of 30,000 Woolongs, you too can be rich!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to be a thief nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are people\Nwho want manuals to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And where is this mail-order company?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a store that's only on the 'net,\Nso I don't know where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the store has already closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.43,0:06:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The hacking unit that was placed\Non the Gates was something that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't be made unless you knew\Nabout the Gate system really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The mastermind's likely someone who has\Nsome connection to the Gate Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my hunch,\Nand I investigated that front,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The programmers would be fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but the guys from the Gate Corporation\Nsuddenly became uncooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as if they knew something,\Nbut didn't want us to find out about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess those are the\Nonly clues we have for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:07:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a memory cartridge for\Nplaying chess over the 'net.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This piece has one match in its memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And, when you push it,\Nit connects to the 'net.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And this has something to\Ndo with this incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe all of this is a game...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, continue playing\Nthat game with the opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go talk to the Gate\NCorporation guys once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lessee...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eenie, meenie, miney, moe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Another bounty hunter?\NI don't care, send him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's asking about\Na chess-loving programmer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Jonathan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,were you another one that went through all the trouble to get nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(341.333,952,1062.667,1054.667)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(341.333,952,1009.334,1054.667)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(341.333,952,954.667,1054.667)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(341.333,952,900.001,1054.667)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 846 952 846 1054 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 791 952 791 1054 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 739 952 739 1054 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 683 952 683 1054 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 629 952 629 1052 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 575 952 575 1052 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 523 952 523 1052 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 468 952 468 1052 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 341 952 l 416 952 416 1052 341 1054)}This thing isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we have given out\Nall the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What more are you saying\Nyou would like to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but there is no smoking\Nallowed in this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I had something\Nthat I wanted you to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a planned game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys at the Gate Corporation\Nshould know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, to put a bounty on a mastermind\Nthat we aren't even sure exists
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,suggests that it's someone you don't\Nwant the police to know about, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounty-hunters should just\Nlook for their bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, and whether\Nor not you used to work for the ISSP,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's better for you to\Nnot make any extra inquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going home. Make sure\Nhe is kindly escorted out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this old piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe our risk is too great.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that gets out to the general public...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am fully aware of our risk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we don't catch him,{\i0}\N{\i1}the situation will just get worse.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why is a ghost from{\i0}\N{\i1}50 years ago coming back now...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To think that he gave{\i0}\N{\i1}everyone a chess piece...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chessmaster Hex...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So it {\i0}is{\i1} a game that he set up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Chessmaster Hex...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No good. This doesn't have anything\Nother than chess data in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they were going\Nto do with such a thing... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is no meaning to the content,\Nmaybe the pieces are the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.39,0:12:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike, I have a name...{\i0}\N{\i1}Can you investigate the guy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He might be the mastermind{\i0}\N{\i1}behind this whole thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed's really busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Checkmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...or so you thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fork the king and the rook!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! This is either an idiot or a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this chap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chessmaster Hex.\NEstimated to be 98 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:13:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A programmer that had been\Ndubbed a genius from his teens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Cosmo-net chess tournaments,\Nhe dominated the champion's seat for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He began work on the Hyperspace Gate\Ncontrol program when he was 30 {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and created the central control system\Nthat all Gates use to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.99,0:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that was his fatal error.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He started to doubt the safety\Nof the Gates he helped create {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and was against putting\Nthem to practical use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, he was banned\Nfrom the Gate Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since, his whereabouts\Nhave been unknown for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's the mastermind behind\Nour current string of crimes. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.11,0:13:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, why is he seeking revenge\N50 years after the fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If we figure out where he is,\Nwe'll know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed's really busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, quit playing games\Nso much and help out a little—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed, we want to figure out\Nwhere a guy named Hex is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hex... Hex...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chessmaster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who I'm playing\Nchess against right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the location we got from\Nthe trace we did on Ed's chess opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys standing by?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's basically giving\Nus his exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we even trust that\Ntrace in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya think he'd be in a dump like this? {timed like this to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.13,0:14:30.14,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\move(724,945,724,1025,779,1200)\t(779,1200,\3c&H000000&)}No, I think it was... that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had heard once that there was a place{\i0}\N{\i1}where all the scrapped remains of{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}obsolete Gates were gathered along with{\i0}\N{\i1}scrap metal and abandoned spaceships{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and that there were people{\i0}\N{\i1}that started living there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why the hell do they want{\i0}\N{\i1}to live here of all places?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That area has no nationality,{\i0}\N{\i1}nor a government.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't have to pay taxes,{\i0}\N{\i1}and there are no cops.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see... It's the perfect place to hide yourself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It might be a trap...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This might be the continuation of the game.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then there is someone here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.69,0:16:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yo, Jet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for leading the way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You... were following us the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tough luck for you, but I have{\i0}\N{\i1}important business with that guy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I'll be going ahead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and love to my bank account!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Chessmaster Hex?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.43,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you be a little quieter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't joke with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with\Npretending to be senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't hand over the money you stole,\Nyou'll get a nice hole in your brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big tube you got there...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whatcha doin', Hex?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hear this. It's my first\Nformidable opponent in quite a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be some player if\Nyou have trouble winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, where's lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are ya saying?\NYou just ate lunch a while back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.76,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:20.76,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Really, you've lost so much of yer mind\Nthat all you can do is play chess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno. But you know, this old fogey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Have ya lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you can speak... You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To... To think my life savings\Nare never coming back... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn... Goddammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone and everyone,\Nyou and that guy over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is all a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do? This old man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't seem to remember anything about yesterday, let alone 50 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hex is no longer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we merely have\Nan old man that loves games.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, Hex was riled up for revenge,\Nand planned this all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it so that this incident\Nwould happen 50 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,during the one moment that the Gate\Nprogram gets automatically updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.18,0:20:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even making those that\Nphysically commit the crime
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,hold chess pieces to hint\Nthat it was his doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,However, to that old-timer,\N50 years was too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He went senile,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and had completely forgotten about\Nthe traps that he himself had set.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it works out better for you this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now you don't have to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the fundamental defect\Nin the Gates leaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, the price you paid was\Nthat {\i1}we{\i0} learned about that defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want? Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,are you planning to leak\Nthis information to the press?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave that old guy alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good deal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed would get lonely if she\Nlost her chess partner...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're playing that thing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again. Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been playing that\Nthing this whole week?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
