Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.81,0:21:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a really easygoing fellow, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
