Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.67,0:24:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Love... It is to believe everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Love... It is the heart that provides for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on... was that what\Nthe story was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.14,0:24:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Love... It is the heart\Nthat accepts everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.38,0:24:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this is getting fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitney... You loved me that much...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.73,0:24:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can't trust\Nthe previews on this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.23,0:24:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A romantic love story for all you lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: My Funny Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.49,0:24:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a lie. A lie.

